      formula: String.raw`\operatorname{Nat}\big(\operatorname{Hom}(-, X), F\big) \cong F(X)`,
      text: "For a locally small category C, an object X and a presheaf F on C, natural transformations from Hom(−, X) to F correspond bijectively to elements of F(X), by evaluating at the identity of X. The bijection is natural in X and F.",
